    "evidence_quote": "Fig. 3. Hierarchical classification of PBPK model types under the A) central class physiologically based pharmacokinetic model (PBPKO:00003). Subclasses include organ-specific models (gut, lung, kidney, brain), population and life-stage-specific models (population, pregnant, lactational), structural model types (whole body, one-compartment), mechanistic approaches (perfusion-limited, permeability-limited), and parameterization strategies (top-down, bottom-up)."
